  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">InBusiness Programme: Enhancing livelihoods of people with disabilities in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Men and women with disabilities who are micro-business owners</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project under the UK funded DID programme with Light for the World as Task Order Management Organisation, and partnering with Humanity &amp; Inclusion, Sense International and UDPK. Scaling three InBusiness models to help build entrepreneurship capacity amount women and men with disabilities: in a refugee setting, with people with complex disabilities and among a broader population of people with disabilities and carers.</narrative>
  </description>
